{"schema_version":"baseline-1.0","run_kind":"single_agent_baseline","sequence":2,"event_id":"evt-238264cf-ed1b-40dd-aeca-3f670ccd959f","run_id":"baseline-c5050235-bb76-4151-a711-c71b345264cb","actor":{"kind":"runtime"},"occurred_at":"2026-11-01T22:37:32.401093100+00:00","prev_hash":"4668d22e20bca564aa8c2e4f1bcd681d5615bdd6a25e4b2641f58ab1ed37dfbd","hash":"138ca0b70711e85e98009ff0bb22cf9ae4cfd442d7bac87ef29403bbe4c852f8","payload":{"type":"recall_planned","plan":{"source":{"kind":"consensus_log","log_sha256":"a76dc21718ca0341bea3cedebe4859dd81856e5421de5046f2eb79570bade427","run_id":"run-a529264a-8aa0-4dfd-92e6-4b55d9d6c615"},"queries":["The payment retry flow already applies a backoff delay between attempts, and this proposal modifies that existing delay instead of adding a new retry mechanism. Checkable against the payment retry implementation or configuration.","Each retry wait will include a randomized jitter component derived from the existing backoff interval, so the applied wait is not solely the deterministic backoff value.","The maximum number of payment retry attempts remains exactly the currently configured attempt limit; no attempt is added or removed.","The payment-client default RetryPolicy is max_attempts=1 with jitter_ms=0 and therefore has no effective between-attempt retry delay; this proposal changes that configuration rather than modifying a pre-existing backoff delay. Checkable against the stored default-policy record and the payments-review decision record.","The proposal sets RetryPolicy.jitter_ms to 50, which satisfies the documented requirement of jitter_ms at least 50 and is not 0; no jitter is derived from any backoff interval. Checkable against the documented decision and the constraint_cap_is_three_attempts test record.","The proposal sets RetryPolicy.max_attempts to exactly 3, changing the default of 1 and not exceeding 3; send_with_retries retains the rule that only SendError::Timeout is retried and upstream errors are returned immediately. Checkable against the documented decision, test constraint, and send_with_retries behavior record."],"limit_per_query":5,"max_records":20}}}
